---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About Us - InfoProds" description="Learn about InfoProds - your knowledge hub for educational articles, miscellaneous content, and product reviews to help you make the best choice.">
  <main>
    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="py-16 bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-900/50 to-blue-900/50">
      <div class="container mx-auto px-4 text-center">
        <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-bold mb-4">
          About InfoProds
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-300 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          Your Knowledge Hub for Smart Decisions
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Mission Section -->
    <section class="py-16">
      <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
        <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
          <div class="text-center mb-12">
            <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-4">Who We Are</h2>
            <p class="text-xl text-gray-300">
              Educational articles, miscellaneous content, and product review articles to help you make the best choice
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mb-16">
            <div class="text-center p-6 bg-white/5 rounded-2xl border border-white/10">
              <div class="text-5xl mb-4">📚</div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">Educational Articles</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm">
                In-depth guides that teach you something valuable across diverse topics
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="text-center p-6 bg-white/5 rounded-2xl border border-white/10">
              <div class="text-5xl mb-4">🔍</div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">Miscellaneous Content</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm">
                Fascinating topics and unique insights that expand your knowledge
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="text-center p-6 bg-white/5 rounded-2xl border border-white/10">
              <div class="text-5xl mb-4">🛒</div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">Product Reviews</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm">
                Comprehensive reviews to help you make informed buying decisions
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="prose prose-invert max-w-none">
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6">Our Story</h2>
            <p class="text-gray-300 text-lg mb-4">
              InfoProds launched in November 2025 with a clear mission: cut through the noise of misleading reviews and marketing hype. 
              We're a specialized team built on a simple principle - consumers deserve honest, research-backed information before they spend their money.
            </p>
            <p class="text-gray-300 text-lg mb-4">
              While we're a recently launched platform, we believe in building a strong foundation of credibility from day one. 
              Our commitment to quality over speed sets us apart. We're not just a product review site - we provide educational 
              value, interesting insights, and diverse content alongside buying guidance.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6 mt-12">Our Content Methodology</h2>
            <div class="space-y-4">
              <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
                <span class="text-purple-400 text-2xl">✓</span>
                <div>
                  <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">Thorough Research</h3>
                  <p class="text-gray-300">We dive deep into topics - analyzing data, studying user experiences, and examining multiple sources to give you complete information</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
                <span class="text-purple-400 text-2xl">✓</span>
                <div>
                  <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">Real-World Analysis</h3>
                  <p class="text-gray-300">For product reviews, we study verified buyer feedback across platforms. For educational content, we present practical, actionable insights</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
                <span class="text-purple-400 text-2xl">✓</span>
                <div>
                  <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">Balanced Perspective</h3>
                  <p class="text-gray-300">We present multiple viewpoints, compare alternatives, and help you understand trade-offs - not just push one option</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
                <span class="text-purple-400 text-2xl">✓</span>
                <div>
                  <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">Original Content</h3>
                  <p class="text-gray-300">Our team creates comprehensive analysis and original insights - never copying sources or recycling generic information</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6 mt-12">Content Categories</h2>
            <p class="text-gray-300 text-lg mb-6">
              We cover diverse topics across 9 comprehensive categories:
            </p>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
              <div class="p-4 bg-white/5 rounded-lg border border-white/10">
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2">🚗 Car Accessories & Care</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm">Product reviews for vehicle technology, maintenance tools, comfort upgrades, and safety accessories</p>
              </div>
              <div class="p-4 bg-white/5 rounded-lg border border-white/10">
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2">💻 Technology & Devices</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm">Reviews and guides for smart gadgets, electronics, connectivity solutions, and innovative tech products</p>
              </div>
              <div class="p-4 bg-white/5 rounded-lg border border-white/10">
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2">🏀 Sports & Sport Info</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm">Educational content about sports - fascinating facts, hidden rules, psychology secrets, tournament insights</p>
              </div>
              <div class="p-4 bg-white/5 rounded-lg border border-white/10">
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2">💪 Fitness & Health</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm">Product reviews for training equipment, wellness tools, health monitoring devices, plus nutrition guidance</p>
              </div>
              <div class="p-4 bg-white/5 rounded-lg border border-white/10">
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2">🏠 Home</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm">Reviews and ideas for furniture, decor, organization systems, and living space solutions</p>
              </div>
              <div class="p-4 bg-white/5 rounded-lg border border-white/10">
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2">🍳 Kitchen</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm">Product reviews for appliances and cookware, plus cooking guides and meal preparation tips</p>
              </div>
              <div class="p-4 bg-white/5 rounded-lg border border-white/10">
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2">💎 Jewelry</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm">Buying guides, care instructions, investment strategies, trend analysis, and authenticity tips</p>
              </div>
              <div class="p-4 bg-white/5 rounded-lg border border-white/10">
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2">💄 Beauty</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm">Product reviews for skincare and cosmetics, plus educational content about ingredients and techniques</p>
              </div>
              <div class="p-4 bg-white/5 rounded-lg border border-white/10">
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2">📦 Miscellaneous</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm">Unique innovations, surprising discoveries, specialty topics, and content that defies traditional categories</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6 mt-12">What Sets Us Apart</h2>
            <div class="space-y-4">
              <div class="p-4 bg-white/5 rounded-lg border border-white/10">
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">Content Speaks for Itself</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-300">We don't over-promise. Our article quality demonstrates our standards - averaging 6,000+ words of comprehensive analysis because superficial content doesn't serve anyone</p>
              </div>
              <div class="p-4 bg-white/5 rounded-lg border border-white/10">
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">Knowledge Hub Approach</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-300">We're not just a product review site. We provide educational value, interesting insights, and diverse content alongside buying guidance</p>
              </div>
              <div class="p-4 bg-white/5 rounded-lg border border-white/10">
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">User Feedback Matters</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-300">We rely on reader input for improvement. Found an error? Let us know. We update content and acknowledge corrections publicly</p>
              </div>
              <div class="p-4 bg-white/5 rounded-lg border border-white/10">
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">Exceptional Experience, Always</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-300">Clear navigation, detailed analysis, actionable recommendations, and content worth your time - every article, every category</p>
              </div>
              <div class="p-4 bg-white/5 rounded-lg border border-white/10">
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">Human Research & Writing</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-300">Every article is researched and written by our team. We believe genuine analysis of sources and user experiences can't be automated</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6 mt-12">Transparency & Trust</h2>
            <p class="text-gray-300 text-lg mb-4">
              For product reviews, we include links to trusted global retailers where products are available. 
              These are affiliate partnerships - we earn commissions on purchases.
            </p>
            <p class="text-gray-300 text-lg mb-4">
              <strong>Here's our promise:</strong> Affiliate relationships never influence ratings or recommendations. 
              If a $200 product performs worse than a $30 alternative based on our research, we'll tell you - 
              regardless of commission differences.
            </p>
            <p class="text-gray-300 text-lg">
              Many sites hide affiliate relationships or inflate ratings for higher earnings. We believe transparency builds trust.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA Section -->
    <section class="py-16 bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-900/30 to-blue-900/30">
      <div class="container mx-auto px-4 text-center">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-4">Ready to Explore?</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-300 mb-6 max-w-xl mx-auto">
          Discover educational content, fascinating topics, and honest product reviews
        </p>
        <div class="flex justify-center gap-4">
          <a href="/" class="px-8 py-3 bg-purple-600 hover:bg-purple-700 rounded-lg font-semibold transition">
            Explore Categories
          </a>
          <a href="/blog" class="px-8 py-3 bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 rounded-lg font-semibold transition border border-white/20">
            Read Our Blog
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>